# Loop 3g-1 (police, part one): the pull-over conversation (docs/design/police.md section 7).
# Only the flow lives here; every word is in game/data/dialogue.json, picked by `talk.say(group,
# tag)` (game/scripts/police/police_talk.gd), which returns the Polish line and keeps its English
# for the balloon. Compiled at runtime by Dialogue Manager 4 (its editor plugin stays off).
# Loop 3g-2: `guard_stop`, the city guard's conversation when the car stops by a guard (police.md
# 5.6): a zone line (talk.zone: "oldtown" on the Market Square and the lanes), one reply, a caution.

~ pull_over
if talk.first_contact
	Sierżant Bogdan: {{talk.say("police_stop", talk.opener)}}
	Sierżant Bogdan: {{talk.say("police_stop", "roosters")}}
	$> talk.done_routine()
	=> END
Sierżant Bogdan: {{talk.say("police_stop", talk.opener)}}
- {{talk.say("police_reply", "")}} => caution
- {{talk.say("police_reply", talk.opener)}} [if talk.has_reply /] => caution

~ caution
Sierżant Bogdan: {{talk.say("police_caution", talk.caution_tag)}}
$> talk.done_caution()
=> END

~ guard_stop
Strażnik Henio: {{talk.say("guard", talk.zone)}}
- {{talk.say("police_reply", "")}} => guard_caution

~ guard_caution
Strażnik Henio: {{talk.say("police_caution", "")}}
$> talk.done_caution()
=> END
